$VER: 1.2

               CNet/3's Extended Manual Index by Dave Anderson

After the arrival of CNet/3, I had determined that the index in the CNet
manual was missing copious amounts of information for the seasoned CNet 
SysOp.  After reading in the FidoNet CNet and CLink CNet Amiga areas about 
everyone having difficulties with the index and the inability to easily
find information about specific topics regarding CNet 3.04, I decided to 
create this esoterically oversized index.   It covers over 550 topics of
interest in regards to CNet and its operation.  I orignally created
this file for myself, but several of you have asked me to make it public,
so here it is.  There is no warranty, batteries, or toll free support 
numbers included :)  Enjoy.  This index is intended for Registered CNet
SysOp's only....Support CNet....The Best Amiga BBS Package!

If you want to print this manual out to match the CNet manual, print it
using 45 lines per page.  The margins otherwise will fit the CNet manual.

If you need to contact me, you can at the following addresses:
  
